&lt;p&gt;Navan has transformed the corporate travel, payment, and expense landscape by relentlessly prioritizing the user experience. As a Senior Frontend Software Engineer in the Flights group, you will play an essential role in building and scaling Navan’s flagship product—a next-generation flight platform that drives global business growth and gets people where they need to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-scale, highly complex engineering environment where your work will directly impact travelers worldwide. You will solve challenging architectural problems, collaborate with a global team of elite engineers, product managers, and designers, and write code that powers a platform trusted by the world&#39;s largest enterprises. If you are passionate about developer experience, system performance, and building flawless user interfaces, this is your place to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the End-to-End Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive complex features from inception to launch. Partner closely with product and design to ship impactful features, monitor their real-world impact, and iterate based on data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect for Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead application design and implement critical portions of our frontend architecture. You will translate complex business requirements into scalable, high-quality technical frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Set the gold standard for frontend reliability, performance, and measurability. You will define the team&#39;s approach to application performance monitoring (APM) and continuously optimize the user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supercharge Developer Velocity:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and refine internal frameworks and frontend pipelines that drastically improve developer experience (DX), code health, and time-to-ship for the entire engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor and Elevate:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish credibility quickly through high-quality code and rigorous design reviews. You will mentor fellow engineers on best practices, modern design patterns, and system architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bridge the Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; While this is a frontend-focused role, you will have the autonomy to work full-stack. A strong understanding of backend systems and APIs will allow you to drive holistic, cross-system improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of dedicated UI/frontend development experience in high-growth, agile environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level proficiency in JavaScript and TypeScript, with strong hands-on experience in modern frontend frameworks, specifically React and Angular.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System-Level Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; A comprehensive understanding of the technical intricacies of large-scale frontend systems, with a sharp eye for identifying and executing architectural improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of driving positive technical change within engineering organizations. You know how to motivate peers, instill technical accountability, and achieve measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; A low-ego, high-impact approach to problem-solving. You communicate complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;The posted pay range represents the&amp;nbsp;anticipated&amp;nbsp;low and high end of the compensation for this position and is subject to change based on business need. To determine a successful candidate’s starting pay, we carefully consider a variety of factors, including primary work location, an evaluation of the candidate’s skills and experience, market demands, and internal parity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For roles with on-target-earnings (OTE), the pay range includes both base salary and target incentive compensation. Target incentive compensation for some roles may include a ramping draw period. Compensation is higher for those who exceed targets. Candidates may receive more information from the recruiter.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$113,400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$252,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navan uses AI-assisted Automated Employment Decision Tool (Metaview) to assist with evaluating resumes against job qualifications for this role. All final decisions are made by human recruiters and hiring managers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Human oversight:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Metaview does not automatically reject candidates or make final hiring decisions. Our recruiters and hiring managers review all outputs and make the final hiring decision regarding every application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your rights: &lt;/strong&gt;If you prefer to have your application reviewed without AI assistance, you may request a human evaluation by entering your email &lt;a href=&quot;https://my.metaview.app/applications/opt-out?organization=15dd7e883f&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Your decision to do so will not affect how your candidacy is evaluated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please refer to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://navan.com/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information about our processing of personal data, and your rights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
